{"id":"brenalt","name":"Brenalt","type":"character","aliases":["Bren","General Brenalt"],"description":"A young soldier who survives an undead ambush by making a pact with an angel, rises to general, and ends the story preparing a last charge against the undead.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2012-07-24","last_seen":"2012-07-24","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Blessed Life","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2012-07-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Blessed Life\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Jul 2012."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"blessed-life-2012-07-24-e0","summary":"An inquisitor demands that the wounded Brenalt explain how he survived, suspecting a deal with a demon.","participants":["inquisitor","brenalt"],"location":null,"importance":"minor","page":"stories/blessed-life-2012-07-24","order":174,"story_date":"2012-07-24","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":3,"quote":"I believe you made a deal for your life, and the seed of darkness is now within you.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=I%20believe%20you%20made,is%20now%20within%20you.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Blessed Life","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2012-07-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=I%20believe%20you%20made,is%20now%20within%20you.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Blessed Life\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"blessed-life-2012-07-24-e1","summary":"In a flashback, Brenalt barricades a ruined shrine and mourns his dead friends Tomas, Edrick and Stanton.","participants":["brenalt","tomas","edrick","stanton","mattias"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/blessed-life-2012-07-24","order":174,"story_date":"2012-07-24","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":5,"quote":"Tomas, Edrick, and Stanton were dead. His best friends.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=Tomas%2C%20Edrick%2C%20and%20Stanton,dead.%20His%20best%20friends.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Blessed Life","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2012-07-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=Tomas%2C%20Edrick%2C%20and%20Stanton,dead.%20His%20best%20friends.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Blessed Life\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"blessed-life-2012-07-24-e2","summary":"Mattias dies after urging Brenalt to run and tell their families.","participants":["mattias","brenalt"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/blessed-life-2012-07-24","order":174,"story_date":"2012-07-24","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":7,"quote":"Mattias's eyes shut and did not open again.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=Mattias%27s%20eyes%20shut%20and%20did%20not%20open%20again.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Blessed Life","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2012-07-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=Mattias%27s%20eyes%20shut%20and%20did%20not%20open%20again.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Blessed Life\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"blessed-life-2012-07-24-e3","summary":"Brenalt prays wordlessly at the altar and an angel appears in warmth and light.","participants":["brenalt","angel"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/blessed-life-2012-07-24","order":174,"story_date":"2012-07-24","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":10,"quote":"This was a creature from a different world, as alien in thought and mind as she was familiar in form.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=This%20was%20a%20creature,was%20familiar%20in%20form.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Blessed Life","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2012-07-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=This%20was%20a%20creature,was%20familiar%20in%20form.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Blessed Life\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"blessed-life-2012-07-24-e4","summary":"Brenalt asks the angel for help, and she nods, granting him strength in a pact.","participants":["brenalt","angel"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/blessed-life-2012-07-24","order":174,"story_date":"2012-07-24","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":12,"quote":"A pact had been reached.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=A%20pact%20had%20been%20reached.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Blessed Life","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2012-07-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=A%20pact%20had%20been%20reached.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Blessed Life\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"blessed-life-2012-07-24-e5","summary":"The inquisitor, softened, tells Brenalt she believes him.","participants":["inquisitor","brenalt"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/blessed-life-2012-07-24","order":174,"story_date":"2012-07-24","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":14,"quote":"I believe you, soldier.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=I%20believe%20you%2C%20soldier.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Blessed Life","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2012-07-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=I%20believe%20you%2C%20soldier.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Blessed Life\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"blessed-life-2012-07-24-e6","summary":"Brenalt rises rapidly through the ranks to general, rumored to be blessed by the angels.","participants":["brenalt"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/blessed-life-2012-07-24","order":174,"story_date":"2012-07-24","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":18,"quote":"General Brenalt had been blessed by the angels, and no matter how bad it got, Brenalt managed to emerge victorious.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=General%20Brenalt%20had%20been,managed%20to%20emerge%20victorious.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Blessed Life","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2012-07-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=General%20Brenalt%20had%20been,managed%20to%20emerge%20victorious.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Blessed Life\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"blessed-life-2012-07-24-e7","summary":"At a council of war Brenalt tells his fellow commanders that angels are alien and cannot be relied on, not even for hope.","participants":["brenalt","angel"],"location":null,"importance":"minor","page":"stories/blessed-life-2012-07-24","order":174,"story_date":"2012-07-24","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":21,"quote":"The angels answered my call once, and whatever they are, I still believe that they might come to our aid.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=The%20angels%20answered%20my,come%20to%20our%20aid.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Blessed Life","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2012-07-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=The%20angels%20answered%20my,come%20to%20our%20aid.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Blessed Life\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"blessed-life-2012-07-24-e8","summary":"A scout reports that the Fourth Legion is lost and River's Glen overrun, and Brenalt reveals it was his home.","participants":["brenalt","general-elise","fourth-legion","river-s-glen","undead"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/blessed-life-2012-07-24","order":174,"story_date":"2012-07-24","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":22,"quote":"The Fourth Legion is lost. The dead have overrun both Greenfield and River's Glen.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=The%20Fourth%20Legion%20is,Greenfield%20and%20River%27s%20Glen.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Blessed Life","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2012-07-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=The%20Fourth%20Legion%20is,Greenfield%20and%20River%27s%20Glen.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Blessed Life\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"blessed-life-2012-07-24-e9","summary":"Brenalt, now crippled and leading a few dozen survivors, sees a necromancer directing the dead below.","participants":["brenalt","necromancer","undead"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/blessed-life-2012-07-24","order":174,"story_date":"2012-07-24","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":28,"quote":"The necromancer was real, after all.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=The%20necromancer%20was%20real%2C%20after%20all.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Blessed Life","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2012-07-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=The%20necromancer%20was%20real%2C%20after%20all.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Blessed Life\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"blessed-life-2012-07-24-e10","summary":"Brenalt screams at the heavens that he gave everything and will die fighting, honoring his promise.","participants":["brenalt","angel"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/blessed-life-2012-07-24","order":174,"story_date":"2012-07-24","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":30,"quote":"I will die fighting. I will die honoring my promise to you.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=I%20will%20die%20fighting.,my%20promise%20to%20you.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Blessed Life","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2012-07-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=I%20will%20die%20fighting.,my%20promise%20to%20you.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Blessed Life\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"blessed-life-2012-07-24-e11","summary":"Brenalt bows his head with the praying refugees and raises his staff for one last charge as the wind changes.","participants":["brenalt"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/blessed-life-2012-07-24","order":174,"story_date":"2012-07-24","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":33,"quote":"He raised his staff toward the enemy, girding himself for one last charge.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=He%20raised%20his%20staff,for%20one%20last%20charge.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Blessed Life","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2012-07-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=He%20raised%20his%20staff,for%20one%20last%20charge.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Blessed Life\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Jul 2012."}}],"relations":[],"pages_say":[{"page":"stories/blessed-life-2012-07-24","order":174,"story_date":"2012-07-24","presence":"appears","source":"wizards","description":"A young soldier who survives an undead ambush by making a pact with an angel, rises to general, and ends the story preparing a last charge against the undead.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Blessed Life","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2012-07-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Blessed Life\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Jul 2012."}}]}
